#. <CLT 4>ここが…舞園さんの部屋か……
#. 見た目はほとんど変わらないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So this is Sayaka's room... It really doesn't look any\n"
"different from mine.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんだか…いい匂いがするな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It smells nice, though..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、こっちの部屋にも
#. モニターがあるんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I shouldn't be surprised to find one in here,\n"
"too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう夜時間だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's officially nighttime.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 外に出ない方がいいよな。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better not leave the room..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、女子の部屋のシャワールームには
#. 鍵が付いてるんだったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I remember right, all the girls' private bathrooms\n"
"have locks on them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中に入るのは…ちょっとためらわれるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm a little reluctant to go in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ベッド自体は、男子の部屋の物と
#. ほとんど変わりないようだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The bed itself looks exactly the same, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで舞園さんが寝ていると思うと、
#. 心なしか、寝心地まで良さそうに思える。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...knowing Sayaka's slept on it makes me look forward\n"
"to trying it out for myself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの部屋にあったのは工具セットだったけど…
#. やっぱり舞園さんの部屋には裁縫セットがあるんだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My room came with a toolkit, but Sayaka has a sewing\n"
"kit. Just like the note said...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>隣のは…
#. これが人体急所マップってヤツか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And next to it is...the map of the body's vital\n"
"organs.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さすがに、他人のゴミ箱を覗くのはどうかと思いつつ、
#. ちらりと中を覗くと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's kind of weird to dig through other people's\n"
"trash, but I couldn't help taking a quick peek...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>間違いない…視聴覚室で配られたＤＶＤだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There wasn't any doubt about it—it was the DVD with\n"
"her name on it that we'd found in the A/V room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば…舞園さんはどんな映像を見せられたのか、
#. 聞けてないままだったな…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That reminds me... I never did get a chance to find\n"
"out what was in her video."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…話してくれるのを、
#. 待つしかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it's probably best if I wait until she brings it\n"
"up again.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、こっちの部屋にも
#. 監視カメラがあるんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It makes sense there'd be one in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう夜時間だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's officially nighttime.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 外には出ない方がいいよな。
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better not leave the room..."
msgstr ""

#. あんまり、部屋をジロジロ見てたら、
#. 舞園さんに悪いよな…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I don't think Sayaka would like me snooping around too\n"
"much..."
msgstr ""

#. …そろそろ、ボクも寝るとするか。
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I should probably go to bed soon."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゆっくりとベッドに体を預けると…
#. 良い香りがふわりと全身を包み込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As I lowered myself onto Sayaka's bed, a pleasant\n"
"fragrance enveloped me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの…香り…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka's...scent...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…いい夢が…見られそうな……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it'll bring me some sweet dreams.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しだけ幸せな気分のまま…
#. ボクは眠りへと落ちていった……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Feeling a little better than before, I fell asleep...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
